sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Customer
    participant p1 as Transfer API
    participant p2 as Risk + Limits
    participant p3 as Account Ledger
    participant p4 as Payment Rail
    participant p5 as Reconciliation
    p0->>p1: Transfer request + unique key
    p1->>p2: Validate ownership and controls
    p2->>p1: Decision
    p1->>p3: Create pending balanced entries
    p1->>p4: Submit stable transfer reference
    p4->>p1: Success or unknown timeout
    p1->>p5: Resolve uncertain provider state
    p5->>p3: Finalize or reverse based on evidence
